## Set vs Map vs object

| | Set | Map | Object |
|---|-----|-----|--------|
| Keys | Values only | Any type | String/symbol only |
| Order | Insertion | Insertion | Integer keys first (!) |
| Size | `.size` | `.size` | `Object.keys().length` |
| Lookup | `has()` O(1) | `get()` O(1) | O(1) |
| Iterable | ✅ | ✅ | Needs `Object.entries` |

That integer-key ordering is the trap:

```js
