## Space complexity too

Count extra allocation, not the input:

```js
function sum(arr) { let t = 0; for (const n of arr) t += n; return t; }   // O(1)
function double(arr) { return arr.map((n) => n * 2); }                    // O(n)
function fib(n) { return n <= 1 ? n : fib(n-1) + fib(n-2); }              // O(n) stack
```

Recursion costs stack space equal to its depth — frequently forgotten.

