## Step 1 — precompute the index

```jsx
const index = useMemo(
  () => items.map((item) => ({ item, search: item.title.toLowerCase() })),
  [items]                       // recomputed only when items change
);

const results = useMemo(() => {
  const q = query.toLowerCase();
  if (!q) return items;
  return index.filter((e) => e.search.includes(q)).map((e) => e.item);
}, [index, query, items]);
```

The lowercase conversion now happens once per item, not once per keystroke. For most real datasets this alone is sufficient.

