## Choosing

| Situation | Use |
|-----------|-----|
| Default, readable code | Sort |
| k much smaller than n | Min-heap |
| Large n, one-off query, mutation allowed | Quickselect |
| Streaming data | Min-heap — sorting needs the whole set |
| Repeated queries | Sort once, index many times |

That last row is worth raising: if the question is asked repeatedly, sorting once amortises to O(1) per query.

